From ac5ba6cfe5a627deb545fabbc86b036a8988f7bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ci <ci@local>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 22:18:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] feat(mddbd): embed mddb-panel web UI and serve it from
 mddbd.exe

Add //go:embed of services/mddbd/webui so a single mddbd.exe serves both
the JSON API and the React panel with zero external dependencies. A new
UI handler wraps the API mux: API/control-plane prefixes (/v1, /graphql,
/playground, /metrics, /health, /debug) are delegated untouched, and all
other routes fall through to the embedded SPA (index.html) for client-side
routing.

The webui directory is populated at CI build time by copying the built
panel dist into it; a .gitkeep placeholder keeps the package compiling when
the panel is not built (e.g. the windows-runtime test job).
---
 services/mddbd/main.go            |  9 ++++
 services/mddbd/ui_embed.go        | 16 ++++++
 services/mddbd/ui_handler.go      | 90 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 services/mddbd/ui_handler_test.go | 59 ++++++++++++++++++++
